open NumberField IsDedekindDomain Formalism.BasicNotions Formalism.MainNotions.S Formalism.MainNotions.S.Lat Formalism.MainNotions.S.LocalSplitGroups Formalism.L2.SG.TermDef Formalism.L2.SG.DataCut
